OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric building to undergo      
OL,4,A#626,000 renovation                    
OL,6,FA council is spending #626,000 to      
OL,7,Fconserve its historic building.        
OL,9,FCity of Lincoln Council said it was    
OL,10,Frepairing the Grade I listed Stonebow  
OL,11,Fand Guildhall "to address defects      
OL,12,Fwithin the building" discovered in a   
OL,13,Fstructural investigation.              
OL,15,FIt houses the council's meeting chamber
OL,16,Fand has been the seat of local         
OL,17,Fgovernment since the medieval period.  
OL,19,FThe current building on the city's High
OL,20,FStreet incorporates an archway and     
OL,21,Fdates back to the early 1500s,         
OL,22,Faccording to the Visit Lincoln website.
